## 📂 Project Structure

The repository is organized topic-wise under the `src` directory.

```text
Python/
│
├── src/
│   │
│   ├── Python-basics/
│   │   └── Python fundamental concepts
│   │
│   ├── Datatype/
│   │   └── Python data types and operations
│   │
│   ├── Coditional-statement/
│   │   └── Conditional and decision-making programs
│   │
│   ├── looping/
│   │   └── for, while and nested loop programs
│   │
│   ├── Break,Pass,Continue/
│   │   └── Loop control statements
│   │
│   ├── Function/
│   │   └── Function-based programs and exercises
│   │
│   ├── HOF(Higher Order Function)/
│   │   └── map, filter, reduce and functional programming
│   │
│   ├── Genrators/
│   │   └── Generator functions and expressions
│   │
│   ├── oops/
│   │   └── Object-Oriented Programming concepts
│   │
│   └── Advance-Python/
│       └── Advanced Python concepts
│
├── requirements.txt
│
└── README.md
```

> **Note:** The folder names above reflect the current repository structure. As the repository evolves, folder names may be cleaned up to follow consistent Python naming conventions.

